<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38067" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-tĕnŭis</span></b> ,
		e, adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Very thin</i> or <i>slender</i>
			(post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">folium pinūs,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					16, 10, 16, § 38</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fila,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					16, 31, 56, § 128</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">19, 6, 34,
				§ 116</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bracteae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					33, 6, 32, § 100</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pons,</span>”
				<i>very narrow</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					50, 76, § 201</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Of sound, <i>very thin</i> or <i>shrill</i>, <i><span class="en">Quint. 11,
				3, 41</span></i>.</div>
